WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:17.944
Meeting someone is surely

00:17.944 --> 00:21.114
The dawn within our hearts

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
And a new breeze is born from there

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Once you've realized you're not alone

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
The translucent Moon will smile

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Then, the prelude you can hear in your spirit

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Is a nostalgic but unusual song

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Surely

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Everyone is born so that they can meet someone

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, out into the boundless world...

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Yes, so we may search for love

01:35.554 --> 01:37.754
Breakfast was delicious again today, Mai.

01:38.824 --> 01:40.294
Thank you very much!

01:40.294 --> 01:43.534
You could even work as a cook
in the lunar royal court.

01:43.534 --> 01:46.624
N-no, not at all! That's going too far!

01:50.174 --> 01:51.264
Miss Mai!

01:53.414 --> 01:55.044
Are you all right?

01:55.044 --> 01:57.044
Thank you, Mia.

01:57.044 --> 02:01.574
It's nothing. Oh, I'll help
with the dishes, all right?

02:04.884 --> 02:11.294
I'm glad. It looks like both you and Mia
have gotten quite used to living here.

02:12.824 --> 02:14.764
Well, I guess I'll get going.

02:14.764 --> 02:16.594
Okay, see you later.

02:17.134 --> 02:18.734
Where is Tatsuya going?

02:18.734 --> 02:22.774
Next door. He's working a shift tonight.

02:22.774 --> 02:27.264
A shift? So early? He's quite dedicated, isn't he?

02:34.054 --> 02:37.254
By the way, there is something I've been
wondering for some time now...

02:37.254 --> 02:38.244
Yes?

02:38.454 --> 02:40.424
What does it mean to "work a shift"?

02:42.454 --> 02:43.894
- Episode 3-
The Princess and
the Cooking Battle!

02:43.894 --> 02:46.794
- Episode 3-
The Princess and
the Cooking Battle!
The Princess and the Cooking Battle!

02:46.794 --> 02:48.424
- Episode 3-
The Princess and
the Cooking Battle!

02:52.364 --> 02:56.874
I'm sorry about today. We had a bunch
of reservations suddenly come in...

02:56.874 --> 02:58.864
That's all right. It's Sunday and all.

02:59.304 --> 03:03.214
It may be a Sunday, but you
still had lots to do, right?

03:03.214 --> 03:04.514
Like what?

03:04.514 --> 03:08.354
Well, I mean, showing Feena around town.

03:08.354 --> 03:10.824
There are still a lot of places
she doesn't know about yet, right?

03:10.824 --> 03:12.254
Yeah, true...

03:12.524 --> 03:15.994
I'd tag along as well if I only had the time.

03:15.994 --> 03:18.024
Thank you, Natsuki.

03:18.024 --> 03:21.014
Oh no, it's nothing for you to thank...

03:24.634 --> 03:25.934
Feena!

03:33.144 --> 03:36.274
"It'd be easier just to see it firsthand," huh?

03:36.274 --> 03:41.754
Sis could be right, but...
This was way too sudden!

03:41.754 --> 03:43.944
That may not be all it was.

03:44.184 --> 03:45.154
Jin!

03:45.154 --> 03:50.324
It's just possible that the young lady
was concerned about you.

03:50.524 --> 03:53.194
No way. That's not it at all!

03:53.194 --> 03:58.534
Honestly... You're a bit dim when it
comes to this sort of thing, aren't you?

04:00.204 --> 04:01.334
What is this?

04:01.334 --> 04:05.104
Vegetable juice. Oh, do you not like it?

04:05.744 --> 04:07.764
That's not it. Thank you.

04:11.144 --> 04:16.684
So, engaging in labor in-between
school lessons is to "work a shift," is it?

04:16.684 --> 04:19.084
Well, that's more or less it.

04:19.084 --> 04:21.894
Tatsuya works because he says he
wants to save up even a little

04:21.894 --> 04:24.864
to help if something happens to his family.

04:25.594 --> 04:29.364
Is that so? And why do you work
as a waitress, Natsuki?

04:29.364 --> 04:36.104
Well, there's the fact that I live here...
But I guess because it's fun.

04:36.374 --> 04:37.574
Fun?

04:37.574 --> 04:40.674
When I bring customers their food
and their faces get all happy,

04:40.674 --> 04:43.244
it makes me sort of happy, too.

04:43.244 --> 04:45.444
So there's that, and other things as well.

04:45.444 --> 04:46.744
Oh Feena, dear...

04:47.784 --> 04:51.254
Brother! You're acting WAY too familiar with her!

04:51.254 --> 04:55.294
If you do something strange to her,
this time it's not gonna end well!

04:55.294 --> 04:59.624
Now now, little sister of mine.
I would do no such thing, would I?

04:59.994 --> 05:05.094
Don't let your guard down! Anything this guy
does, he's always up to no good!

05:06.164 --> 05:09.034
You must be bored just sitting there, no?

05:09.034 --> 05:12.804
This time, why not try your hand at
helping Tatsuya and us at work?

05:13.844 --> 05:16.444
What are you talking about, all of a sudden?!

05:16.444 --> 05:17.714
Would that be all right?

05:17.714 --> 05:19.144
Feena!

05:19.144 --> 05:20.874
T-Tatsuya!

05:21.484 --> 05:22.544
Feena...

05:26.084 --> 05:31.114
This, too, is part of my studies here on Earth.
I ask you let me "work a shift".

05:32.664 --> 05:34.134
Tatsuya...

05:34.134 --> 05:37.434
If this is what Feena wants,
we should support her.

05:37.434 --> 05:38.164
Right?

05:40.064 --> 05:41.934
I thank you for your support.

05:43.404 --> 05:48.774
A-all right, fine! You just leave everything to me!

05:53.344 --> 05:56.874
Greetings, customer!
Welcome to Trattoria Samon!

05:58.654 --> 06:00.644
Please follow me to your table.

06:02.824 --> 06:06.954
Would you care to try our special of the day,
Mediterranean-style peperoncino?

06:08.594 --> 06:10.084
Very well.

06:10.434 --> 06:12.934
Sir! Two special du jours!

06:12.934 --> 06:14.124
Okay!

06:15.734 --> 06:18.934
Greetings, customer!
Welcome to Trattoria Samon!

06:21.814 --> 06:23.984
Incredible, huh?

06:23.984 --> 06:25.144
She really is.

06:25.144 --> 06:27.844
You just barely taught her,
and she's already that good.

06:28.914 --> 06:33.044
Keep your guard up. Unexpected incidents
are a part of the service industry...

06:35.324 --> 06:37.084
P-please stop!

06:37.364 --> 06:41.794
What's the harm? Come play with Daddy!

06:41.794 --> 06:43.264
This is most disturbing!

06:43.264 --> 06:44.564
C'mon, it's all right!

06:45.704 --> 06:46.834
S-stop!

06:46.834 --> 06:47.604
It's all ri-

06:47.604 --> 06:48.904
No!!

06:49.004 --> 06:51.204
What are you doing?

06:51.204 --> 06:52.874
It should be plain to see!

06:52.874 --> 06:57.074
I am simulating a troubling situation
that Feena could find herself in.

06:57.244 --> 06:59.304
Now look here...

06:59.684 --> 07:01.014
Jin.

07:10.054 --> 07:13.464
U-um, Jin didn't mean any harm by it.

07:17.104 --> 07:19.964
Thank you very much for your concern.

07:22.674 --> 07:25.044
But I will be fine.

07:25.044 --> 07:28.034
Even if by chance such an
insolent person were to appear...

07:35.784 --> 07:40.744
He would be no match for me
regarding knowledge of the blade.

07:43.654 --> 07:45.194
In more ways than one...

07:45.194 --> 07:47.284
Sh-she's pretty awesome.

07:53.204 --> 07:56.234
Thank you so very much, Miss Feena.

07:56.234 --> 07:59.764
No, thank you. I only hope
I wasn't too much of a bother.

08:00.104 --> 08:02.544
A bother?! No, nothing of the sort!

08:02.544 --> 08:06.774
You were far more helpful
than my no-good son here.

08:08.554 --> 08:13.654
What is it, Brother? It's not like you for
something like that to get you down.

08:13.654 --> 08:15.254
For her to have been able to so
flawlessly execute her work...

08:15.254 --> 08:23.024
I, personally, had hoped
for more of a series of mishaps.

08:25.264 --> 08:29.774
I'm sorry! I really am such a klutz!

08:29.774 --> 08:32.934
Please teach me! Sir Jin!

08:33.204 --> 08:36.644
We'll just let Natsuki handle
this sort of thing, Feena.

08:39.544 --> 08:43.184
I'm sorry! I really am such a klutz!

08:43.184 --> 08:46.484
Please teach me! Sir Jin!

08:46.484 --> 08:50.554
We'll just let Natsuki handle
this sort of thing, Feena.

08:51.164 --> 08:54.124
Now THAT would be a most
pleasant turn of events!

08:54.194 --> 08:57.024
With Thoughts of
Big Brother

08:57.264 --> 08:59.204
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

08:59.204 --> 09:02.634
My older brother really is an incurable idiot!

09:02.634 --> 09:05.264
What plans do you have after this?

09:05.674 --> 09:10.544
We're free until the restaurant
opens up again for dinner.

09:10.544 --> 09:11.604
Feena!

09:12.314 --> 09:13.334
Yes?

09:13.614 --> 09:17.814
In addition to being a waitress,
there are other things that you must study.

09:19.054 --> 09:22.694
What do people do in a place like this?
Answer please, today's Tatsuya!

09:22.694 --> 09:24.224
"Today's..." What's that supposed to?

09:24.224 --> 09:25.994
Uh, they eat.

09:25.994 --> 09:27.894
Correct! That is exactly right!

09:27.894 --> 09:32.804
Then shouldn't you learn about not just dealing
with customers but also cooking?

09:32.804 --> 09:34.034
Cooking?

09:34.034 --> 09:36.574
What are you talking about, you child?!

09:36.574 --> 09:37.844
Yeah!

09:37.844 --> 09:39.304
It sounds interesting.

09:40.874 --> 09:42.244
Feena!

09:42.244 --> 09:43.984
Then it's settled.

09:43.984 --> 09:47.314
In order to know Feena's true skill,

09:47.314 --> 09:49.074
she will challenge Natsuki!

09:50.754 --> 09:52.854
Hold on! "Challenge"?

09:52.854 --> 09:54.824
Representing the Moon,
Feena!

09:55.224 --> 09:57.554
Representing the Earth,
Natsuki Takamizawa!

09:57.794 --> 10:03.064
These two will battle it out, the honor of
each of their homeworlds on the line!

10:03.364 --> 10:08.304
Hold on a minute, why am I the one
who has to challenge Feena?

10:08.704 --> 10:10.534
Are you afraid of losing?

10:11.844 --> 10:15.514
Oh, so that's it? Natsuki,
you don't think you can win, huh?

10:15.514 --> 10:18.614
The daughter of a restaurateur
losing to a novice princess!

10:18.614 --> 10:20.984
I can understand your cowardice.

10:20.984 --> 10:23.644
After all, it looks like she already beat you
when it comes to customer service!

10:24.184 --> 10:26.924
And if I stay silent and listen, you just say
whatever the hell you want!

10:26.924 --> 10:27.914
Earth!

10:28.154 --> 10:29.594
Calm down, Natsuki!

10:29.594 --> 10:33.224
I mean, anything you cook gets carbonized,
so you challenging someone would be-

10:33.934 --> 10:34.624
Ulp!

10:34.864 --> 10:39.064
I won't be the Master Carbonizer forever!

10:43.074 --> 10:46.234
The Princess went off,
leaving me on my own again...

10:46.644 --> 10:49.204
I'd have liked to have joined her!

10:50.214 --> 10:52.774
Mia, are you in your room?

10:54.254 --> 10:56.484
Ah, there you are.

10:56.484 --> 10:58.054
Is something wrong?

10:58.054 --> 10:59.544
It's so terrible!

11:00.524 --> 11:02.544
WHAT?!

11:06.094 --> 11:07.854
Th-the Princess?!

11:14.274 --> 11:18.134
Yo, Tatsu! We got some great mackerel in today!

11:18.404 --> 11:19.664
Ah, hello.

11:20.844 --> 11:23.644
Way to go, Tatsu! Woo-Woo!

11:23.644 --> 11:27.584
N-no, it's not like that! Oh jeez...

11:33.454 --> 11:38.094
Oh, I see. So this is what fish are like.

11:38.094 --> 11:40.524
Is this unusual for you?

11:40.524 --> 11:45.234
I haven't really seen food
before it's been prepared before.

11:45.234 --> 11:46.534
Young Miss!

11:49.334 --> 11:50.844
How 'bout some potatoes?

11:50.844 --> 11:52.404
You could make some
meat-n-potato stew with these,

11:52.404 --> 11:54.804
show off your homemakin' skills
to your man there!

11:55.774 --> 11:58.674
Sir! We don't have that kind of relationship!

11:59.014 --> 12:02.644
See?! Your strange talk is troubling Feena!

12:03.114 --> 12:04.124
Excuse me!

12:04.124 --> 12:05.244
Welcome!

12:05.524 --> 12:08.214
What seasonal vegetables do you... Huh?

12:09.624 --> 12:11.694
Natsuki, you're shopping here too?

12:11.694 --> 12:12.964
Th-that's right!

12:12.964 --> 12:16.954
This is bad. Now Natsuki knows
you've been cheatin' on her!

12:17.404 --> 12:20.674
Look, I'm just helping her shop...

12:20.674 --> 12:24.444
Wait, why do you assume
I'm dating THIS wacko?!

12:24.444 --> 12:27.044
Wacko? What do you mean, "wacko"?!

12:27.044 --> 12:31.344
More to the point, Tatsuya, I assume
you're up to no good with Feena here!

12:31.344 --> 12:33.214
Of course not!

12:33.214 --> 12:36.954
Feena doesn't know anything about the
marketplace, so I just came to show her around!

12:36.954 --> 12:39.384
But why did YOU have to do it?

12:39.384 --> 12:42.414
Th-that's just sort of how it turned out...

12:42.754 --> 12:44.954
Anyway, you've got Mai with you!

12:45.764 --> 12:49.234
To be honest, that gives you a
MUCH bigger advantage!

12:49.234 --> 12:53.504
That's right! And I'm grateful!
She'll be a lot more helpful than you, huh?

12:53.504 --> 12:55.934
Why you!

12:59.504 --> 13:03.874
I'm sorry. The two of them
get like this sometimes.

13:03.874 --> 13:06.174
The truth is, they really do get along.

13:12.554 --> 13:15.494
Is this all of the shopping, Feena?

13:17.964 --> 13:18.984
Feena?

13:23.894 --> 13:25.424
Do you like that?

13:27.804 --> 13:34.974
It's nice here. Everyone calls out in a friendly
voice and it feels so warm and welcoming.

13:34.974 --> 13:38.714
People talk to you like that on the Moon, right?

13:38.714 --> 13:44.174
Yes... But it is always as a lunar princess.

13:45.024 --> 13:48.584
Do you also treat me kindly because
I am a princess of the Moon?

13:57.504 --> 13:59.634
It is about time for my challenge.

13:59.634 --> 14:01.294
Uh... Yeah.

14:01.974 --> 14:03.704
COOKING
BATTLE!!

14:03.704 --> 14:04.574
Moon
vs.
Earth

14:04.574 --> 14:05.374
Cooking

14:05.374 --> 14:06.174
Earth

14:06.174 --> 14:06.934
Moon

14:19.254 --> 14:21.454
Do you want me to help you, Feena?

14:21.454 --> 14:25.164
This is a cooking challenge.
I must do it on my own.

14:25.164 --> 14:27.164
Natsuki...

14:27.164 --> 14:29.524
I'm not going to lose to Feena!

14:50.754 --> 14:55.344
Moon vs. Earth Cooking Battle!!

14:56.724 --> 14:58.264
MOON VS. EARTH
COOKING BATTLE!!

14:58.264 --> 15:02.164
All right, the two challengers' cooking
would appear to be near completion!

15:02.164 --> 15:05.654
Before that, let's introduce our judges!

15:05.964 --> 15:09.734
Owner and chef of Trattoria Samon,
Mr. Samon Takamizawa!

15:11.744 --> 15:14.934
Chief Secretary to the President,
Sayaka Hozumi!

15:15.974 --> 15:18.814
And master of the film industry,
Takeshi Takano!

15:18.814 --> 15:21.714
Incredible!

15:22.054 --> 15:26.484
The lunar princess's own cooking!
If this isn't worth recording, then what is?!

15:26.824 --> 15:30.354
Uh, and for our final judge...

15:30.354 --> 15:33.724
I would like to select one member
of our viewing audience.

15:39.064 --> 15:39.764
All right!

15:39.764 --> 15:44.224
A hopeful contender has already appeared!
Young lady, who might you be?

15:44.744 --> 15:46.074
WHAT'S YOUR NAME?!

15:47.444 --> 15:49.464
Wreath...

15:51.484 --> 15:56.744
The Moon vs. The Earth! The cooking
battle of the century begins now!

15:59.754 --> 16:01.454
I won't be beaten, Feena!

16:01.454 --> 16:02.424
Nor shall I!

16:02.654 --> 16:06.694
Very well, let's proceed to our first tasting.

16:06.694 --> 16:10.424
Our initial presentation will be from
Feena Fam Earthlight!

16:13.404 --> 16:15.564
Good luck, Princess!

16:17.744 --> 16:19.844
Some astonishing news!

16:19.844 --> 16:23.804
This was our contestant's
very first attempt at cooking!

16:24.044 --> 16:29.254
I am embarrassed to simply slice
vegetables and call it "cooking"...

16:29.254 --> 16:33.314
but my aim was for you to be able to enjoy
the vegetables' pure, fresh flavor.

16:33.524 --> 16:37.894
While just a salad, it is a splendid dish.
Well done.

16:37.894 --> 16:42.724
The lunar princess's very first cooking!
Nice! Very nice!

16:43.064 --> 16:44.724
Very well, let's taste it.

16:53.574 --> 16:54.564
Princess...

16:57.914 --> 16:59.474
How is it?

17:02.584 --> 17:06.024
It's delicious!

17:07.054 --> 17:09.594
The salt-and-vinegar dressing is simple,

17:09.594 --> 17:12.184
but there's just the right amount to draw out
the flavor of the other ingredients.

17:12.794 --> 17:14.434
Good news huh, Feena?

17:14.434 --> 17:15.494
Yes.

17:15.494 --> 17:17.434
But I mustn't let my guard down yet.

17:17.704 --> 17:21.154
Next up, the cooking of
Miss Natsuki Takamizawa!

17:25.004 --> 17:26.874
Good luck, O Younger Sister.

17:27.004 --> 17:29.004
Win! You must win, Natsuki!

17:29.344 --> 17:32.404
Oh my, best of luck, Miss Natsuki!

17:32.984 --> 17:34.554
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
Shut up!

17:34.554 --> 17:34.854
With Thoughts of
Big Brother

17:34.854 --> 17:35.904
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
Maid!

17:38.584 --> 17:42.494
U-um... What is this?

17:42.494 --> 17:43.924
Salad...

17:44.154 --> 17:45.784
I see.

17:45.894 --> 17:46.794
Salad.

17:48.194 --> 17:50.134
HOW THE HECK CAN YOU CALL THIS SALAD?!

17:50.334 --> 17:52.004
It wasn't my fault!

17:52.004 --> 17:53.634
I thought just a salad would be too plain,

17:53.634 --> 17:56.124
so I tried cooking it a bit
and this is how it turned out!

17:56.274 --> 17:58.564
Take a bite of this, my staff!

18:04.744 --> 18:06.644
Moving on to the next course...

18:06.644 --> 18:08.044
Don't just ignore mine!

18:10.514 --> 18:13.044
This too is a simple dish...

18:14.424 --> 18:18.914
No. The flavors of the ingredients really
come together, creating a nice balance.

18:19.264 --> 18:21.924
It has a light flavor that I really like.

18:22.134 --> 18:25.124
Now then, next we have
the cooking of Miss Natsuki.

18:26.004 --> 18:28.074
This time it's sure to be all right.

18:28.074 --> 18:30.094
After all, there's no way soup could be...

18:37.614 --> 18:40.084
JUST HOW MUCH DO YOU HAVE TO HEAT IT
TO TURN IT INTO THIS?!

18:41.414 --> 18:42.854
Eat it! Eat it!

18:44.154 --> 18:46.684
L-let's pull ourselves back together
and move on to the third course.

18:46.684 --> 18:49.254
We still don't know how this battle will turn out!

18:49.254 --> 18:53.464
The results of this next dish
could turn things around!

18:53.464 --> 18:57.154
Put simply, turn things around, Natsuki!
You must win!

18:57.464 --> 19:00.704
Why do you keep supporting me like this?

19:00.704 --> 19:04.904
The answer, of course, is because you are
my cute younger sister.

19:05.174 --> 19:06.474
Big Brother...

19:08.144 --> 19:09.714
You're not going to
fool me like that!

19:09.714 --> 19:10.904
With Thoughts of
Big Brother

19:13.684 --> 19:16.774
Hey. Don't forget your promise, Jin.

19:17.014 --> 19:22.494
Once a day, we eat all we want here.
You're the only one who bet on Natsuki!

19:22.494 --> 19:26.624
That... That's because no one else
would bet on her!

19:26.624 --> 19:31.234
Listen, Natsuki! If you win, I'll get coupons
to all the shops in the arcade!

19:31.234 --> 19:32.024
With Thoughts of
Big Brother

19:32.234 --> 19:35.074
I thought it was something like that!

19:35.074 --> 19:36.534
Potato!

19:45.584 --> 19:45.744
Moon vs. Earth
Cooking Battle

19:45.744 --> 19:48.414
Moon vs. Earth
Cooking Battle
Very well, we will now announce the results.

19:48.414 --> 19:48.814
Moon vs. Earth
Cooking Battle

19:49.054 --> 19:52.044
The winner: Princess Feena Fam Earthlight!

19:54.284 --> 19:57.284
Congratulations, Madam Princess!

19:59.694 --> 20:02.264
That's good! And that's good, too!

20:02.264 --> 20:06.224
Thank you, Tatsuya.
It's because you stood by me that I...

20:07.064 --> 20:08.294
Tatsuya?

20:14.274 --> 20:15.714
T-Tatsuya!

20:15.714 --> 20:18.804
It really was impressive how burnt
you managed to get these.

20:19.444 --> 20:23.114
It all goes back to your prior problem of,
shall we say, cooking ability.

20:23.114 --> 20:27.854
In a way, you actually have a gift.
The Master Carbonizer is alive and well.

20:27.994 --> 20:33.824
You shut up! I know it, all right?!
No one would want to eat my food!

20:38.204 --> 20:40.604
Well, you've gotten a little better, I think.

20:40.934 --> 20:42.364
Tatsuya...

20:45.804 --> 20:48.244
Hey, you just remember your promise.

20:48.244 --> 20:50.304
All you can eat. All you can eat!

20:50.544 --> 20:52.774
You get no pay for six months!

20:55.014 --> 20:58.454
Six months? Well doesn't that rock?

20:58.454 --> 21:00.084
Rock lobster...

21:00.624 --> 21:02.924
You did it, Madam Princess!

21:02.924 --> 21:04.084
Yes...

21:04.964 --> 21:07.454
Still, you really are incredible!

21:07.564 --> 21:09.594
Hey, I had something in mind for that!

21:09.594 --> 21:11.334
What could you possibly have had in mind?

21:11.334 --> 21:13.024
I swear!

21:15.074 --> 21:16.374
Good morning!

21:16.374 --> 21:17.534
Morning...

21:17.534 --> 21:19.474
Hey, it's really incredible!

21:19.774 --> 21:20.704
What is?

21:20.704 --> 21:23.264
Feena's cooking again!

21:23.874 --> 21:24.844
Miss Feena!

21:27.714 --> 21:29.414
I'm terribly sorry...

21:29.414 --> 21:34.124
It wasn't the Princess's fault!
She still isn't accustomed to cooking.

21:34.124 --> 21:37.144
If you'd kindly overlook this,
I'll make something...

21:43.394 --> 21:46.664
I'd wanted to eat that since yesterday.
Feena's cooking.

21:48.004 --> 21:49.564
Tatsuya...

21:50.304 --> 21:53.004
I'll try harder next time.

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
That platinum-colored crescent moon

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Stands still now, gently

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
I look up at the sky and think

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
That falling star is surely the Moon's tears

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
And I thought of you

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Why do I cry these tears?

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Though all I am doing is praying for eternity...

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
I want to walk with you, believing in the future

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
No matter how many times
the Moon waxes and wanes

23:25.164 --> 23:26.634
Preview

23:26.634 --> 23:28.674
Preview
Faced with wicked intruders, the proud princess
heads alone toward the battlefield

23:28.674 --> 23:31.504
Faced with wicked intruders, the proud princess
heads alone toward the battlefield

23:31.504 --> 23:33.544
in the most controversial Dawning Blue story!

23:33.544 --> 23:35.714
Will she be able to make it through this?!

23:35.714 --> 23:36.674
Jin, you get into a pretty bad situation yourself.

